  Source: https://github.com/rlabduke/reference_data, files
  Top8000/Top8000_ramachandran_pct_contour_grids/rama8000-*.data at commit
  5ee6875fc29eccc3c9dc7cbe705ff9fd1b505d7d.
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
